_needs_human_review", "effective_from": null, "effective_to": null, "notes": null}, {"rule_id": "APH-CH2-2.5", "source_edition": "AICTE Approval Process Handbook 2024–25 to 2026–27", "source_document": "2025031399.pdf", "annexure": "Chapter II", "source_clause": "2.5", "printed_page": 15, "application_category": "Existing Institution — EoA", "requirement_type": "process", "requirement_text": "EoA may be granted based on self-disclosure of facilities/infrastructure; Council may monitor compliance and initiate penal action for non-fulfilment.", "applicability_condition": "EoA based on self-disclosure", "verification_status": "draft_extracted_needs_human_review", "effective_from": null, "effective_to": null, "notes": null}]'::jsonb
